- **Why:** `12f8e566` reads snapshots with `Disallow`, so a snapshot written by `e6f92a5f` carrying a new member would be refused; and once a Care pack or Staging row exists the old version refuses to start on such an overlay and hides such quotes (W2 Part 3, B167 `:15`, B168-1). Never run R-1 from `wt-B268-release` (its PRE-1 would pass Care pack rows that 12f8e566 then refuses at start, W2 Part 3).
- Every rollback ends in `ROLLED BACK:`. Write `## Rollback note (for Tuesday and Kam)` either way.

